    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0RC_1LC1RC_1RA0LD_0RC1LB [SCycL 3 0; SWin 3; SWinL 4] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

