    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0RC_1RC0LD_1LD0LA_0RB1LA p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0RC_1RC0LD_1LD0LA_0RB1LA p j' E).
