    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StB, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0RD_0LB1RC_1LD0RB_1LA1LD [SCycL 6 0; SWin 8] (StB, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
