Module LAPT_1RB0RD_0LC0RB_1LA1LC_1LC1LD.
(** * LAPT_1RB0RD_0LC0RB_1LA1LC_1LC1LD: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0RD_0LC0RB_1LA1LC_1LC1LD, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

